WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.300
People don't only search any more.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.200
They ask their AI.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.500
The chains are ready for that.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.400
The bakery, bike shop and farm shop
down the road usually aren't.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.500
Gentifi puts independent businesses
in their customers' AI.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.600
Send us your price list,
or just take a photo of it.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.700
Check the draft, and you're live.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.600
Customers scan your sign once,

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.400
then ask their AI what you've got,
when you're open, and to put something aside.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.700
Nothing is ordered until they confirm.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.400
It comes to you the way orders do now.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.900
Same till. Same shop. Easier to find.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.500
Gentifi your business. At gentifi.com.
